.TH MINIOS-WELCOME-PATCH 8 "August 2026" "MiniOS" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
minios-welcome-patch \- configure the Firefox MiniOS welcome page
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B minios-welcome-patch
.RB [ \-\-check ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B minios-welcome-patch
adds a managed block of MiniOS preferences to each supported Firefox system
configuration file. Before changing a file, it stores the unmodified contents
in a file with the
.B .bak
suffix. Repeated invocations do not duplicate the managed block.
.PP
Desktop-specific preferences are selected using
.BR /etc/minios/config .
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-check
Exit with status 0 when every existing supported Firefox configuration file
contains the MiniOS managed block. Exit with status 3 when an existing file is
not configured, or 4 when no supported configuration file exists.
.SH FILES
.TP
.B /etc/minios/config
MiniOS system configuration.
.TP
.B /usr/share/minios/html/index.html
Welcome page configured as the Firefox startup welcome URL.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR firefox (1)
